// Test fixture: a module that declares a `native fn` the AOT backend has no
// curated stub for (`getpid` is a libc call). `import modules.hostclock;` makes
// it available as `modules.hostclock.getpid`. The VM resolves it through its
// host registry; the AOT backend must reject a qualified call to it
// (PHASE 7f.2).
//
// The symbol must stay one the AOT runtime has no binding for: `clock` was this
// fixture's symbol until `clock()` became an AOT builtin (BACKLOG §6 item 25).

native fn getpid(): int;
